<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom share trade resumes.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom share trade resumes.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade resumed in Portugal Telecom on Monday after a brief interruption caused by a wrongly-inserted order, dealers said.</p>
<p>The share was up 2.7 percent at 6,877 escudos but in trade of just 5,409 shares.</p>
<p>($1=173 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
